menu "MCP23017 GPIO configuration"

    config MCP23017_CS_GPIO
        int "MCP23017 chip-select GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 39
        help
            GPIO number used to drive the CS pin of the MCP23017/MCP23S17 expander.
            Pick a pad that supports output mode and is not shared with the ADC or other peripherals.

    config MCP23017_RESET_GPIO
        int "MCP23017 reset GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 18
        help
            GPIO number connected to the expander reset input. Select a valid
            output-capable GPIO or keep the default value if the reset pin is
            wired only to the ESP32.

endmenu
